From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:26:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 5418 (5149 part E): a helper hears only the true reason she
 was asked
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Giorgi (G-060 / G-061): his own helper was told „შენ იმიტომ გკითხეს, რომ
შენს კონტაქტებშია <an unrelated contact of hers>" and then three of her
contacts with „write both". He had named her himself: the only true reason
is that he asked.

- When the owner named the helper himself (his typed line or tapped
  button names her, or the server sent his own words), the search reason is
  no longer told her: the bridge need goes without the person a search found
  through her. Her own fitting people may still be offered.
- „both" is said only under exactly two names; under three or more the hint
  is the same sentence without it („… დაწერე მათი სახელები.").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
